<!--
  Unmaximize (restore a maximized window to floating): big rounded window, small
  window at bottom-left, arrow from the top-right pointing INWARD toward the small
  one - "shrink into windowed". SH's composition.
  Its neighbour Maximize is DELIBERATELY a font glyph, not a mirrored drawing: a
  mirror differed only in arrow direction and the two were too easy to confuse at
  bar size (tried and reverted 2026-07-22). Do not "complete the pair".
  Arrowhead is two perpendicular ticks, not a filled triangle - filled heads smear
  at bar size. Stroke-drawn, tinted at runtime.
-->
